<root>
  <!--
    Deutsch — the second language, and the proof that a language is a folder (task b9dd4a25).

    Every key en-US/Resources.resw has, in the same order, and nothing else; LocalisationTests
    holds the two to the same key set. Wording follows astrid-web/lib/i18n/locales/de.json
    wherever the web has the string, so the same thing is called the same on both.

    Two are localised on purpose rather than by translation: tasks_unassigned_mark is the first
    letter of the language's word for "unassigned" (Nicht zugewiesen — N), and the four ordinal_*
    keys are the suffix forms, which in German are all the number and a full stop.
  -->
